OL,3,GNEWSAHealth boss outlines priorities
OL,4,Aahead of election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's health service must
OL,7,Fbalance "ever-changing standards and
OL,8,Foptions" with clearer communication and
OL,9,Fstronger public trust as it navigates
OL,10,Ffinancial pressures, waiting lists, and
OL,11,Fservice changes, Manx Care's interim
OL,12,Fchief executive has said.
OL,14,FChris Stockport has been in the role
OL,15,Ffor two months after the previous chief
OL,16,Fexecutive stood down.
OL,18,FAhead of the island's election on 24
OL,19,FSeptember, improving healthcare and
OL,20,Ffinancial efficiencies has been cited
OL,21,Fas a priority for many candidates.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
