OL,3,GNEWSAHealth boss outlines priorities
OL,4,Aahead of election
OL,5,
OL,6,FStockport said moving forward, there
OL,7,Fwould be a focus on reducing waiting
OL,8,Flists and "flow through our hospitals"
OL,9,Fand length of stays. The Department of
OL,10,FHealth and Social Care was asked for
OL,11,Fcomment.
